        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Clarify constructed stylesheet wording in adoptedStyleSheets intro]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45671</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45671"/>
        <updated>2026-09-13T05:13:50.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198354403?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Clarifies the intro paragraph on the <code class="notranslate">Document.adoptedStyleSheets</code> page so it's clear that any constructed stylesheet may be adopted, not only ones created directly with the <code class="notranslate">CSSStyleSheet()</code> constructor.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The previous wording said only stylesheets "created using the <code class="notranslate">CSSStyleSheet()</code> constructor" may be adopted, which reads as excluding constructed stylesheets obtained other ways (e.g. imported as CSS modules), even though those are also constructed stylesheets and are adoptable. Maintainer <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena">@Josh-Cena</a> confirmed the page was technically correct but confusing and suggested the replacement wording used here.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto"><em>No response</em></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #45668.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5437467411" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45668" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45668/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45668">#45668</a></p>
<p dir="auto">🤖 Generated with <a href="https://claude.com/claude-code" rel="nofollow">Claude Code</a></p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://claude.ai/code/session_01BhNBS7g5CdZsp5sg6NrUzw" rel="nofollow">https://claude.ai/code/session_01BhNBS7g5CdZsp5sg6NrUzw</a></p>]]></content>
