        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add a passkey glossary entry]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45667</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45667"/>
        <updated>2026-09-13T03:44:48.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229418842?u=7d062faa679963052685abcfb94895e5a17314c9&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Add a concise glossary definition for passkeys, covering their public-key model, website scope, authenticators, and common storage options.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Passkeys are a common web authentication term, and a glossary entry gives MDN pages a consistent target for short definitions while linking readers to the full passkeys guide.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">The definition is consistent with MDN's existing passkeys guide and the Web Authentication specification.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
