        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Clarify aria-selected states for single-select trees]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45645</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45645"/>
        <updated>2026-09-11T22:08:09.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292674468?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Corrects the single-select tree guidance so <code class="notranslate">aria-selected</code> is <code class="notranslate">true</code> on the selected tree item, <code class="notranslate">false</code> on other selectable tree items, and omitted only from tree items that are not selectable.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The previous wording told readers to omit <code class="notranslate">aria-selected</code> from every unselected item. That made it difficult for assistive technologies to distinguish an unselected selectable item from an item that cannot be selected.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Validated with the target-page MarkdownLint, Prettier, front-matter, and file-check scripts under Node 24.21.0 and npm 11.19.0.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #41378.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3478927005" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41378" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41378/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41378">#41378</a></p>]]></content>
